[{"sha":"12e3736496b10bcaa3aecb6c787d4a6c57a2c76d","node_id":"C_kwDOMRKUA9oAKDEyZTM3MzY0OTZiMTBiY2FhM2FlY2I2Yzc4N2Q0YTZjNTdhMmM3NmQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"diana","email":"diana.kocsis@uniswap.org","date":"2026-09-22T23:11:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-22T23:11:09Z"},"message":"chore(deployments): point the default UniversalRouter key at 2.1.2 on all chains (#169)\n\nThe unversioned `UniversalRouter` key is what the dev portal surfaces as the\ndefault router, but it had drifted: on the 19 chains that still carried it, it\npointed at a 2.1-generation deploy (v2.0 on ink and monad), and on eight chains\nit was missing entirely -- dropped by #165 on mainnet, sepolia and ink, and\nearlier by #134/#123/#126 on base, linea, x-layer, 4217 and 4326 when those\nrouters were version-tagged.\n\nSo `UniversalRouter` resolved either to a router the 2.1.2 migration docs are\ntelling integrators to move off, or to nothing at all, depending on the chain.\n\nAlias the bare key to each chain's 2.1.2 router on all 23 chains that have one\n(8 added, 15 refreshed). The versioned `UniversalRouter#v2.1.2` entries are\nuntouched, so pinning a specific version still works; the bare key is now a\npointer to the current recommended router.\n\nNote this supersedes the pre-#165 values rather than restoring them -- the\ndefault has never pointed at 2.1.2 on any chain before now.\n\nEdits are to the `latest` map in deployments/json/<chain>.json plus the matching\nsummary-table row, detail section and TOC entry in deployments/<chain>.md.\nDeployment History is untouched. The markdown was hand-edited rather than\nregenerated because regenerate_deployment_markdown.py is not idempotent on this\ntree: it reorders rows, re-adds a dropped history entry, and rewrites commit\nlinks to the git@ form derived from the local git remote.\n\nNot covered: monad testnet (10143) has no 2.1.2 deployed, so its default is\nstill the v2.0 router at 0x3ae6d8a282d67893e17aa70eBfFb33EE5aa65893. Rootstock\n(30) has no UniversalRouter at all. Both need a deploy, not a registry edit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eeafd09ce3fe6c54eedf820b9a523357e8cdb8ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniswap/contracts/git/trees/eeafd09ce3fe6c54eedf820b9a523357e8cdb8ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniswap/contracts/git/commits/12e3736496b10bcaa3aecb6c787d4a6c57a2c76d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqswsNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAccQABbzHQmOsbyEblcriXFnEQcn\nh8liPG5BIJixY0MJ+Y9XdgGEO5aKz3faIA7PyZq8HwwXpEBjUdJx+QgrFOZBNYko\nGGrwFh/pHIPMDHseqM1ue0L/jW0YXDdPmFhfubvlrzNyeIXsYiEajFlcT0XYoxey\n5Adm+GvgZtxwiVqIn2gMAQRiqPMjgMVGIGdYC8yuVoR/4kkubWSzamfmNw27YThD\nf1Di+FvisAnpN/9iKi7tMcJk0qid47lheq+Y0ma4NxsVDYHvOOQmicqO/PLRd2aS\nG6L/RnC2+Vrv3iP78LSrKeCnufJC4WLrK94TXlnk/iRN5sCvoyz07nkAzohx0Pim\n849oFHvUqcsJL1R2BN+ut+9kW1OVSBpECfIG1RtsUKnFFyLSNgogsJWWWBAsIojB\nzxkc9tutMw59npVMkR9dwVKKRAMSu+qJltMwvt3Iu4TZcpkZaJv9HQCBQ3zA2f/K\njLMLnhG2Bsu74Qvp8LNOx3Lu3O3ag2Z9bZM4EKjOX3Iwkgq80pwgsmfan9m/V7el\nZZtH727whanJYVhM9b+tm/1STX/ellX3wIKL8pfHwudXlkPA08RemWRFS3/4jUYG\nXFSlK5YtIMKJBDZzaIY3rQp79jgQ0SYttzW5FVJ4BhRzgyF/xdZAFBk4U2y79+Rq\nb5ASSe/8F0ymXMwqDr3u\n=gRZ+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree eeafd09ce3fe6c54eedf820b9a523357e8cdb8ce\nparent a677c0d4b5fb6e3357cf6d0f0315bcb135a1e1ee\nauthor diana <diana.kocsis@uniswap.org> 1790118669 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790118669 -0400\n\nchore(deployments): point the default UniversalRouter key at 2.1.2 on all chains (#169)\n\nThe unversioned `UniversalRouter` key is what the dev portal surfaces as the\ndefault router, but it had drifted: on the 19 chains that still carried it, it\npointed at a 2.1-generation deploy (v2.0 on ink and monad), and on eight chains\nit was missing entirely -- dropped by #165 on mainnet, sepolia and ink, and\nearlier by #134/#123/#126 on base, linea, x-layer, 4217 and 4326 when those\nrouters were version-tagged.\n\nSo `UniversalRouter` resolved either to a router the 2.1.2 migration docs are\ntelling integrators to move off, or to nothing at all, depending on the chain.\n\nAlias the bare key to each chain's 2.1.2 router on all 23 chains that have one\n(8 added, 15 refreshed). The versioned `UniversalRouter#v2.1.2` entries are\nuntouched, so pinning a specific version still works; the bare key is now a\npointer to the current recommended router.\n\nNote this supersedes the pre-#165 values rather than restoring them -- the\ndefault has never pointed at 2.1.2 on any chain before now.\n\nEdits are to the `latest` map in deployments/json/<chain>.json plus the matching\nsummary-table row, detail section and TOC entry in deployments/<chain>.md.\nDeployment History is untouched. The markdown was hand-edited rather than\nregenerated because regenerate_deployment_markdown.py is not idempotent on this\ntree: it reorders rows, re-adds a dropped history entry, and rewrites commit\nlinks to the git@ form derived from the local git remote.\n\nNot covered: monad testnet (10143) has no 2.1.2 deployed, so its default is\nstill the v2.0 router at 0x3ae6d8a282d67893e17aa70eBfFb33EE5aa65893. Rootstock\n(30) has no UniversalRouter at all. Both need a deploy, not a registry edit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-22T23:11:09Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniswap/contracts/commits/12e3736496b10bcaa3aecb6c787d4a6c57a2c76d","html_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/contracts/commit/12e3736496b10bcaa3aecb6c787d4a6c57a2c76d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Uniswap/contracts/commits/12e3736496b10bcaa3aecb6c787d4a6c57a2c76d/comments","author":{"login":"dianakocsis","id":59492811,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDkyODEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59492811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d